In AIR 1988 SC 897 (G.Ramegowda V/s. Special Land Acquisition Officer,
Bengaluru), Hon'ble Apex court pleased to observe that;
 Judge Sign  12  Crl.A.No.10142023  and Crl.A.No.1015/2023  Judgment  'Sufficient cause' in Section 5 must receive a liberal  construction so as to advance substantial justice and  generally delay in preferring appeals are required to be  condoned in the interest of justice where no gross  negligence or deliberate inaction or lack of bonafides is  imputable to the party seeking condonation of the delay.
